.
.  Generate sample output for scatter plot matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na spmatr2.ps
device 2 postscript
thickness 0.2
.
SKIP 25
READ CURRIE.DAT ID1 ID2 FRWC CTOTAL POTASSIU LEAD IRON SULFEROX
SKIP 0
.
CHAR 1 2
LINE BLANK BLANK
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 8 8 92 92
LOWESS FRACTION 0.6
TIC MARK LABEL SIZE 12
LABEL SIZE 12
CHAR SIZE 12 12
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 5 5
MAJOR TIC MARK NUMBER 3
.
VARIABLE LABEL POTASSIU POTASSIUM
VARIABLE LABEL SULFEROX SULFURCR()OXIDE
SET SCATTER PLOT MATRIX FIT LOWESS
SET SCATTER PLOT MATRIX TAG ON
SCATTER PLOT MATRIX POTASSIU LEAD IRON SULFEROX ID2
.
MOVE 50 96
JUSTIFICATION CENTER
HEIGHT 3.5
TEXT Pollution Data
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv SPMATR2.PS spmatr2.ps
. quit
